  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 901.04 Incorporated Definitions, Abbreviations, and Acronyms. Any term, abbreviation, or acronym used in this chapter that is defined in Env-Wt 100 shall have the meaning established therein, as summarized in Appendix E.\n\nSource. #12809, eff 12-15-19",
